<title>PORTUGAL: Engil sees 1.72-1.75 bln esc 1997 profit. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Engil sees 1.72-1.75 bln esc 1997 profit. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Construction company Engil-SGPS said it expected to make a net consolidated profit of 1.72-1.75 billion escudos in 1997.</p>
<p>Sales would exceed 70 billion escudos, it said in a communique. (Corrects from &quot;would not exceed ...)</p>
</text>
